.DS_Store

# Staged and rendered by `site/build.py`; neither is committed.
site/_stage/
_site/

# `site/hooks.py` imports `site/build.py`, so running the site build leaves bytecode behind.
# Nothing here was imported before that — `check-requirements.py` is only ever executed — which
# is why this repository had no Python ignore rule until now.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The locked renderer is installed into a virtualenv rather than into the system interpreter.
# AGENTS.md §"Before you commit" puts it at `site/.venv`; the rule is by name, so one placed
# elsewhere in the tree is ignored too.
.venv/
